#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-modules/sphinx.xml:121
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Assuming <xref linkend=\"cython\"/> and <xref linkend=\"pytest\"/> are "
"installed, but the other optional dependencies are not, the installation can"
" be tested with the following commands:"
msgstr ""

#.  no && because of a possible error
#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-modules/sphinx.xml:126
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>python3 -m venv --system-site-packages testenv &amp;&amp;\n"
"source testenv/bin/activate                    &amp;&amp;\n"
"pip3 install sphinx[test] defusedxml           &amp;&amp;\n"
"python3 -m pytest\n"
"deactivate</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#.         Six tests, <filename>
#. test_build_latex.py::text_latex_labels</filename>,
#. <filename>test_ext_autodoc.py::test_autodoc_special_members</filename>,
#. <filename>test_ext_autosummary.py::test_autosummary_generate_content_for_module_imported_members</filename>,
#. <filename>test_util_docutils_sphinx_directive.py::test_sphinx_directive_parse_content_to_nodes</filename>,
#. <filename>test_util_docutils_sphinx_directive.py::test_sphinx_directive_parse_text_to_nodes</filename>,
#. and
#. <filename>test_util_typing.py::test_is_invalid_builtin_class</filename>,
#.         are known to fail due to changes in docutils-0.22 and Python 3.14.
#. https://github.com/sphinx-doc/sphinx/issues/13945 is related to the
#.         autodoc failure, which is Python 3.14 related. The remainder are
#. docutils
#.         related. The PR mentioned in #13945 depends on a major refactor of
#. the
#.         autodoc code.
#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/prog/python-modules/sphinx.xml:150
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Four tests (of over 2400 tests) are known to fail: Three in "
"test_ext_autodoc.py and one in test_util_typing.py."
msgstr ""

